  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nThe pageCapture permission allows an extension to call the chrome.pageCapture.saveAsMHTML method. This method will save the page data for any tab, regardless of whether it's a standard web page, chrome:// page or local file. This is true even if \"Allow access to file URL"
